 #!             Hanyang Univ. 2015.Apr.05.            !
 #!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
  
 #*Ref1: T. Fukui, Y. Hatsugai, and H. Suzuki, 
 #       J. Phys. Soc. Jpn. 74, 1674 (2005),
 #       DOI 10.1143/JPSJ.74.1674
 #     'Chern Numbers in Discretized Brillouin Zone: 
 #  Efficient Method of Computing (Spin) Hall Conductances'
 #*Ref2: T. Fukui and Y. Hatsugai, J. Phys. Soc. Jpn.
 #       76, 053702 (2007), DOI 10.1143/JPSJ.76.053702
 #     'Lattice Computation of Z2 Topological 
 #      Invariants and Its Application to Bi and Sb'
 #*Ref3: R. Resta, J. Phys.: Condens. Matter. 12, R107 (2000)
 #     'Menifestations of Berry's phase in molecules 
 #      and condensed matter'
 #*Ref4: W. Yao, D. Xiao, and Q. Niu, PRB 77, 235406 (2008)
 #     'Valley-dependent optoelectronics from inversion
 #      symmetry breaking'
 #*Ref5: http://www.andrew.cmu.edu/user/feenstra/wavetrans/
 #       R. M. Feenstra and M. Widom                  
 #       some routines has been adopted from WAVETRANS
 #*      routines for Wavefunction reading and G 
 #       matching 
  
 #*Syntax:
 # ./vaspberry -f file -kx nx -ky ny -s 2 -ii ni -if nf
